FINDING MC-S00: under-normalized symbol keys (form+medium+era+register+audience required; a bare sign is an inadequate key, spec §6): storm-slate (blue-black wool; the storm cloak's dye) (missing medium); fleece-white (undyed wool; the fold's own color) (missing medium); ridge-grey (rain-worn rock; the descent's unwashed grey fleece) (missing medium); pack-ox (the salt-bearer; the animal of the tally-harness) (missing medium); wind-rider (the large soaring carrion bird of the high ground; species fixed against the biome list at integration) (missing medium); rock-whistler (the alpine burrowing rodent; high burrows, sleeps the winter under the high ground) (missing medium); ten (the whole cord; two crossings of five station-knots) (missing medium); the axle-star (the unmoving one; the light the turning sky is hung on) (missing medium); ...
